---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quality & Testing Overview | Renol Foods Bavla"
  description="Overview of standard quality evaluation parameters, mesh calibration, and technical testing for food powders manufactured by Renol Foods in Bavla, Ahmedabad."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Ambient Radial Glow -->
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-10 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] rounded-full blur-[140px] opacity-20"
      style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #38bdf8 0%, transparent 70%);"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>

    <div class="section-container relative z-10">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Evaluation Standards"
        title="Quality & Testing Overview"
        subtitle="Standard physical, chemical, and organoleptic testing parameters assessed across our dehydrated and spray-dried food powder lines."
      />

      <!-- Hero Primary Action Button (1 per hero) -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <a href="/contact#sample-quote" class="btn-accent min-h-[44px]">
          Request a Sample
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-10">
        <!-- Testing Framework Card -->
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-[#121214] border border-white/10 space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">
              Standard Batch Evaluation Parameters
            </h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 font-body">
              Every production batch in Bavla is evaluated against pre-defined physical and analytical benchmarks to guarantee consistency across commercial manufacturing lines:
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 4 Testing Parameters: 2 cols on tablet/desktop, 1 on mobile -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-2">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#18181c] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
                <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Moisture Control</h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
                Monitored with moisture analyzers to safeguard powder flowability, avoid caking, and preserve microbiological stability during shelf storage.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#18181c] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Particle Size & Mesh</h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
                Sieved and calibrated from coarse seasoning mesh (40–60 mesh) to fine instant beverage dispersion (80–120 mesh) based on client line specs.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#18181c] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
                <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Solubility & Reconstitution</h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
                Assessed for rapid rehydration without unwanted sedimentation, clumping, or lumping in automated food and beverage blending processes.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#18181c] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
                <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Color & Aroma Consistency</h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
                Sensory evaluation compared against reference baselines to ensure natural fruit and vegetable acidity, vibrancy, and profile fidelity.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Documentation & Traceability Box -->
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-[#121214] border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <h4 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">
            Batch Documentation & Certificates
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
            Each commercial dispatch is accompanied by standard commercial documentation. Certificate of Analysis (COA) specifying measured moisture, bulk density, particle size, and organoleptic parameters is generated and verified before dispatch.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-white/80 font-mono">
              Certificate of Analysis (COA)
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-white/80 font-mono">
              Batch Traceability Coding
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-white/80 font-mono">
              Full Specs on Request
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- One Closing CTA Section Near the End of the Page -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-[#0e0e12] text-white text-center border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="section-container max-w-3xl">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-white/40 block mb-3 font-mono">Specification Inquiries</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight">
        Need detailed product specification sheets?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-body">
        Contact our technical sales desk to request product specification sheets, parameter details, or evaluation samples for your formulation trials.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact#sample-quote" class="btn-accent min-h-[44px]">
        Request a Sample
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
